{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1338.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"2f373d89758755f134b8cd530879404a034efdbc62ecf02024d239f50a583f63","ja":"もやしの行方","zh":"豆芽菜的去向","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1338.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"51aedba7f536561cf21869e0c0e2eb17dbdd793c6b97813a88ac8cebb8e12f75","ja":"ジュリアさん、杏奈ちゃん、ちょっと\n聞きたいことがあるんですけど、いいですか？","zh":"茱莉亚先生、杏奈，我有点\n事情想问问你们，可以吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1338.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"7b998774e84c332c16a27592835280ae7d0b54bc4bcc6fa001e85ad8e0e240c9","ja":"どうしたんだ、ヤッコ。\nウチらで良かったら話を聞くぜ。","zh":"怎么了，奴子。\n要是我们帮得上忙，尽管跟我们说。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1338.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"b2498a03ec2695698f4d70784f3d32f6cde8b18e1f7ce4e60d0da5a0a21319b5","ja":"えっと……このあたりでもやしを売ってる\nスーパーって知りませんか？","zh":"那个……请问您知道这附近哪家超市\n有卖豆芽菜吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1338.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"4dfc8c5d090341a35a62faf2d9b46b52b719644b380d7e242a869ed3acd5df6d","ja":"もやしって……あのもやし、だよね……？\nやよいちゃんの行くスーパー、売ってない……の？","zh":"豆芽菜……就是那个豆芽菜，对吧……？\n小弥生常去的那家超市，没有……卖的吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1338.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"268694dcdb46ad8e85da4c996f9cfe269c2cfb3f721ccf419f9e056df076aa16","ja":"いつもは売ってるんだけど、\n最近ずっと売り切れになっちゃってて。","zh":"平时都有卖的，\n但最近一直处于售罄状态。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1338.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"50eea48ed20ca3f30bc894e223e037767e0855a002fe80ce10635940e3d0e98a","ja":"う～ん……あたしは料理しないから、\n分かんないな……。","zh":"嗯～……因为我平时不做饭，\n所以不太清楚呢……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1338.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"18603b7400261641235d1ed543fdd21f6448175804e2ba662351d1ac2bb07e91","ja":"じゃあ、杏奈……ちょっと、調べてみる、ね……。","zh":"那，杏奈……去查查，看……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1338.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"4b407352578f61723ca35386d1bf28ce9832872c707dc674cf7e608b70252f8c","ja":"他のスーパーも……売り切れてるとこ、\n多いみたい……。","zh":"其他超市也是……售罄的地方\n好像挺多的……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1338.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"de17adf61367b9d0dde52b66c7fcf1042823f56daf22562850fd7b6d8846a04b","ja":"それと、もやしが売り切れてる理由……\n分かった、かも……。","zh":"还有，豆芽卖光的原因……\n我好像……知道了……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1338.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"f5ceafd8eaec803536ccd0d583fb2c90c30a3284dfa5e4327bb5729990810fe8","ja":"えっ、本当！？　杏奈ちゃん、教えて！","zh":"欸，真的吗！？杏奈，快告诉我！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1338.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"525da38ac0f433c056a88daba1a083951dfc6c1e04d55a9f2591e3da4916e8bc","ja":"少し、前に……ギャル雑誌の\nインタビュー、一緒に受けた、よね……？","zh":"之前……我们一起接受了\n辣妹杂志的采访，对吧……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1338.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"3d81a47af528d7ba30d5eaa39c0cb2de13334d9978952acb0febe48ec31060d0","ja":"うん、覚えてるよ！\nたしか、もやし料理のお話をして……。","zh":"嗯，我记得哦！\n好像聊了关于豆芽料理的事情……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1338.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"222790512d4966a68db49ba93d180a91a899877e1016c1c0a3a6595ad872b2bb","ja":"たぶん……それが原因だと思う、よ……。","zh":"大概……我觉得那就是原因，吧……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
